WRF-ARW Testcase

This is a test case that uses:

  (a) SGP region with 1 nest (9 km)
      Lambert projection
  (b) Simulation time period from 12Z 11 Jul 2015 to 12Z 12 Jul 2015
  (c) MODIS+lakes geographical data, GFS data
  (d) Goddard MP (option 7) and Goddard 2017 radiation (option 5)

Compare with wrflis_noahmp36_modis_gdas 
